# Powers the "Ask about me" section (src/app/api/chat/route.ts).
# Create a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys, then copy this file to
# .env.local and paste it in. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Anyone who opens the page can spend against this key, so set a credit
# limit on it in the OpenRouter dashboard before you deploy. The route's
# own rate limit is in-memory and resets whenever a serverless instance
# recycles, so it slows abuse down rather than capping spend.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
